WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.296
This walkthrough adds your team. Names turn the name box on each report into a pick list, and member IDs make reminders actually notify each person.

00:00:09.496 --> 00:00:17.654
On the settings page, under Team, switch on the roles you have. Then type each person’s name and press Add. Names save straight away.

00:00:17.854 --> 00:00:25.585
To make reminders notify someone on Slack, open their profile, press the three dots for More, and choose Copy member ID.

00:00:25.785 --> 00:00:33.495
On Discord, turn on Developer Mode in your settings, under Advanced. Then right click the person and choose Copy User ID.

00:00:33.695 --> 00:00:42.920
Back on the settings page, paste the ID into the box next to their name, and press Save team. Untick Remind for anyone who should be listed but never chased.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:49.187
That is your team set up. Reports now have pick lists, and reminders reach the right person.
